<section class="sec" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fqg">
      <div class="fqh rv"><h2>Mobile app questions</h2><p>Can’t find what you need? Start a brief and a real person replies.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/#brief' ) ); ?>">Start your brief <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></a></div>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-iphone-android-or-both"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>iPhone, Android or both?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Platforms</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>MVP</b><small>iOS or Android, one platform</small></span><em class="g">One</em></p><p><span><b>Growth</b><small>iOS and Android, cross-platform</small></span><em class="g">Both</em></p><p><span><b>Full Scale</b><small>Both, with a design system</small></span><em class="g">Both</em></p></div></div></div><p>MVP is built for one platform, iOS or Android. Growth and Full Scale are cross-platform, so one shared codebase runs on both iPhone and Android, where that suits the app. Platform coverage and device features are confirmed in your quotation.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-a-mobile-app-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does a mobile app cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>MVP</b><small>One platform · standard UI kit · 30-day warranty</small><em>RM18,000</em></div><div class="on"><b>Growth</b><small>iOS + Android · custom UI · 60-day support</small><em>RM35,000</em></div><div><b>Full Scale</b><small>Offline sync · live tracking · 90-day SLA</small><em>RM60,000</em></div></div></div></div><p>It is a one-time development budget. MVP is from RM18,000 for one platform with a standard UI kit, basic search and filtering, store submission help and a 30-day bug warranty. Growth is from RM35,000 for iOS and Android with custom UI/UX, a payment gateway or WhatsApp API, analytics and crash reporting, full store setup and 60-day support. Full Scale is from RM60,000 with a design system, offline mode and background sync, real-time updates or live tracking, role permissions and audit logs, a dedicated staging app and a 90-day priority SLA.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-who-puts-it-on-the-app-store-and-google-play"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Who puts it on the App Store and Google Play?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Store release</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-tag"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Store listing and screenshots</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Submission to App Store and Google Play</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Fixes if a review asks for changes</p><p class="x"><em>+</em>Store accounts are yours and paid separately</p></div></div></div><p>We do. MVP includes store submission help and Growth and Full Scale include full store setup. The store accounts are in your company’s name and paid separately. Approval is controlled by Apple and Google, so we can’t promise a review date, but we handle any changes they ask for.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-it-take-payments-or-send-whatsapp-messages"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can it take payments or send WhatsApp messages?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Connections</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><b>Payment gateway</b><em>Growth</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wa"/></svg></i><b>WhatsApp API</b><em>Growth</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-send"/></svg></i><b>Push</b><em>Growth</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><b>Analytics</b><em>Growth</em></span></div></div></div><p>Yes, from the Growth package, which includes a payment gateway or the WhatsApp API, plus analytics and crash reporting. Payment gateway and WhatsApp fees are paid to those providers.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-does-it-work-offline"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Does it work offline?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Offline</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Orders saved without signal</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Background sync when back online</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Real-time updates and live tracking</p><p class="x"><em>+</em>Offline mode is part of Full Scale</p></div></div></div><p>With Full Scale, yes: the app keeps working without signal, saves what people do and syncs it in the background when they are back online. Full Scale also covers real-time updates such as live tracking. MVP and Growth need a connection.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-is-not-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What is not included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Separate costs</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-tag"/></svg></i><b>Store accounts</b><em>Separate</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Hosting</b><em>Separate</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><b>Licences</b><em>Separate</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><b>Ongoing support</b><em>Separate</em></span></div></div></div><p>Store accounts, hosting, licences and ongoing support after the included period are separate. They are listed in your quotation so you know the running costs before we start.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-after-launch"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens after launch?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>After launch</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Included support</b><small>MVP 30 · Growth 60 · Full Scale 90 days</small></span><em class="g">Included</em></p><p><span><b>System Care</b><small>1 system · monitoring + bug fixes · 1.5 h</small></span><em class="g">RM399/mo</em></p><p><span><b>System Care Plus</b><small>Up to 3 systems · monthly review · 5 h</small></span><em class="g">RM999/mo</em></p><p><span><b>System Priority</b><small>Up to 6 systems · priority queue · 10 h</small></span><em class="g">RM1,999/mo</em></p></div></div></div><p>MVP has a 30-day bug warranty, Growth 60 days of support and Full Scale a 90-day priority SLA. After that, System care keeps the app running: System Care is RM399 a month, System Care Plus RM999 and System Priority RM1,999, with 1.5, 5 or 10 support hours.</p></div></div></article>
